From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anaconda Recipes <recipe-maintainers@anaconda.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 10:00:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Provide ICU's data entry point from the bundled data

tensorflow-text builds ICU 77 from source (its own WORKSPACE pin) but does
not build ICU's data library, so ICU's udata.cpp reference to
U_ICUDATA_ENTRY_POINT (icudt77_dat) is unresolved at runtime and importing
tensorflow_text fails with:

  symbol not found in flat namespace '_icudt77_dat'

The bundled filtered data file defines only the static-style name
(icudt77l_dat).  Rename it to the shared-library entry point name so the
linked-in (filtered) data satisfies ICU's lookup.
---
 third_party/icu/data/normalization_data.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/third_party/icu/data/normalization_data.c b/third_party/icu/data/normalization_data.c
--- a/third_party/icu/data/normalization_data.c
+++ b/third_party/icu/data/normalization_data.c
@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@ U_CDECL_BEGIN
 const struct {
     double bogus;
     uint8_t bytes[223376]; 
-} icudt77l_dat={ 0.0, {
+} icudt77_dat={ 0.0, {
 144,0,218,39,20,0,0,0,0,0,2,0,67,109,110,68,
 1,0,0,0,3,0,0,0,32,67,111,112,121,114,105,103,
 104,116,32,40,67,41,32,50,48,49,54,32,97,110,100,32,
@@ -13973,4 +13973,4 @@ const struct {
 };
 U_CDECL_END
 
-U_CAPI const void * U_EXPORT2 uprv_getICUData_other() { return icudt77l_dat.bytes; }
+U_CAPI const void * U_EXPORT2 uprv_getICUData_other() { return icudt77_dat.bytes; }
